## Usage Notes

This template is designed for comprehensive competitive analysis. Adapt based on:
- Number of competitors (2-5 recommended)
- Depth of analysis needed
- Decision timeline
- Audience (technical vs executive)

**Pandoc Conversion**:
```bash
# Convert to Word
pandoc competitive-analysis.md -o competitive-analysis.docx

# With table of contents
pandoc competitive-analysis.md --toc --toc-depth=2 -o competitive-analysis.docx

# With reference template
pandoc competitive-analysis.md --reference-doc=corporate-template.docx -o competitive-analysis.docx